Dictionary data is NOT covered by the GPL v3
--------------------------------------------
The dictionary files shipped in dict/ (dict-core.db, dict-thieu-chuu.db,
dict-vietphrase.db, dict-tran-van-chanh.db) contain data taken from the
sources below. Each source keeps its own terms. The license and provenance
texts embedded in the .db files (column dict_source.license_text) are built
from the files in license/; a source listed with two files embeds both.

| Source (code)                         | license_kind    | license_id   | File in license/                        |
|---------------------------------------|-----------------|--------------|-----------------------------------------|
| CVDICT (cvdict)                       | open            | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt                        |
| CC-CEDICT (cc-cedict)                 | open            | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt                        |
| Unihan (unihan)                       | open            | Unicode-3.0  | Unicode-License-v3.txt                  |
| Vietnamese Wiktionary (viwiktionary)  | open            | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt and GFDL-1.3.txt       |
| English Wiktionary, Chinese entries (en-wiktionary) | open | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt and GFDL-1.3.txt     |
| Vietnamese Wiktionary, English entries (viwiktionary-en) | open | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt and GFDL-1.3.txt |
| English Wiktionary, Vietnamese entries (en-wiktionary-vi) | open | CC-BY-SA-4.0 | CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt and GFDL-1.3.txt |
| Thieu Chuu, Han Viet Tu Dien (thieu-chuu) | public-domain | CC0-1.0     | thieu-chuu.txt and CC0-1.0.txt          |
| VietPhrase (vietphrase)               | unknown         | (none)       | vietphrase.txt                          |
| Tran Van Chanh, Tu dien Han Viet (tran-van-chanh) | copyrighted | (none)  | tran-van-chanh.txt and CC0-1.0.txt      |

Notes on the entries whose status is not an open license:

- vietphrase: author unknown. "Unknown author" is not "no copyright"; the
  data is not treated as public domain. See license/vietphrase.txt.
- tran-van-chanh: the work is still in copyright and the author is alive. The
  CC0 declaration of the digitiser does not remove the author's copyright. The
  layer is a separate file (dict-tran-van-chanh.db) and can be removed by
  deleting that one file. See license/tran-van-chanh.txt.
- thieu-chuu: the original work is in the public domain; the author's moral
  rights (attribution to Thieu Chuu, Nguyen Huu Kha, 1902-1954) remain. See
  license/thieu-chuu.txt.

